From 8619ecb940136276d21af0ebb946d1b3e118622b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Feb 2026 12:37:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] fix: Correct groundeffectdoodad internal_id type from
 uint32 to string (I-115)

- internal_id is a DBC string offset pointing to model paths, not a numeric ID
- Without this fix, DBCTool stored raw offset numbers instead of resolving model names,
  producing a corrupt DBC with a tiny string block on export

Closes I-115

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
