From 0b6e9de0f9613c6324aa32095312837e735776c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Feb 2026 13:47:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] fix: Correct sortOrder for DungeonMap and DungeonMapChunk
 meta files (I-132)

- DungeonMap.dbc: changed from id ASC to (map_id, floor_index) ASC
- DungeonMapChunk.dbc: changed from id ASC to (map_id, wmo_group_id) ASC

Stock 3.3.5a client expects these DBCs grouped by map_id for floor
lookups. ID-sorted exports broke dungeon world maps (blank screen with
ZoneX: inf) for all Open Azeroth dungeon maps including Gnomeregan.

Same class of bug as I-129 (WMOAreaTable sort order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
