From 41e4e3e88e6e067f8bd67190b615948440e92373 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 03:13:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] fix: Restore WorldStateUI extended_ui string field
 (I-166)

DBC col 59 (extendedUI, string) was missing from both meta files; the trailing
extendedUIStateVariable array carried an extra uint32 in its place. Column count
stayed correct so import/export succeeded silently, but the client read the
integer as a string-block offset - capturing Hellfire towers crashed Lua.

Verified against the Noggit dbd BUILD 4.0.0.11792-3.3.5.12340 block.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
